@PasswordTool.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7072

### List supported algorithms
GET {{PasswordTool.Api_HostAddress}}/api/password/algorithms
Accept: application/json

### Hash a password (development only; never put a real production secret in a saved .http file)
POST {{PasswordTool.Api_HostAddress}}/api/password/hash
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "example-only-password",
  "algorithmName": "argon2id"
}

### Inspect a stored hash
POST {{PasswordTool.Api_HostAddress}}/api/password/inspect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storedHash": "<paste-a-supported-hash>"
}

### Verify a password
POST {{PasswordTool.Api_HostAddress}}/api/password/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "example-only-password",
  "storedHash": "<paste-a-supported-hash>"
}